@startuml MidpointSurfInviteFlow
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "MidPoint admin" as Admin
actor "Inviter" as Inviter
actor "Guest" as Guest

participant "MidPoint\n(IDM/IGA)" as IDM
participant "invite_bridge" as Bridge
participant "SURF Invite" as Invite
participant "Institutional SCIM" as SCIM
participant "Mail" as Mail
participant "SURFconext / eduID" as Auth
participant "Application" as APP

note over IDM,Invite
  MidPoint-leading: MidPoint owns Role create/delete.
  Invite owns invitation UX.
  Users + memberships enter MidPoint via SCIM.
  MidPoint unassign of Invite-SCIM members
  notifies Invite (drift prevention).
end note

== 1. Create role (MidPoint → Invite) ==
Admin ->> IDM: Create Role
IDM -->> Admin: Role created
Bridge ->> IDM: Poll / list Roles
IDM -->> Bridge: New Role
Bridge ->> Invite: POST /api/external/v1/roles
Invite -->> Bridge: 200 (Invite role id)
Bridge ->> IDM: Store costCenter=invite:{id}
Invite ->> SCIM: POST /Groups (echo)
SCIM ->> IDM: Match existing Role by name\n(MIDPOINT_LEADING_GROUPS; no duplicate)
IDM -->> SCIM: OK
SCIM -->> Invite: 201 / OK

== 2. Invite users ==
alt From MidPoint GUI (additionalMenuLink)
  Admin ->> Bridge: Open "Invite user" form
  Bridge ->> Invite: POST /api/external/v1/invitations\n(role must have scimResource)
else From Invite application UI
  Inviter ->> Invite: Invite users to Role
end
Invite ->> Mail: Send invitation email(s)
Mail -->> Guest: Invitation link
Guest ->> Invite: Accept invitation
Invite ->> Auth: Authenticate (eduID)
Auth -->> Invite: Identity
Invite ->> SCIM: POST /Users (+ idempotent reuse)\n+ PATCH /Groups members
SCIM ->> IDM: UserType + Role assignment\n(+ store extension/scimResource)
IDM -->> SCIM: OK
SCIM -->> Invite: Success

== 3. Sign in (demo app) ==
Guest ->> APP: Sign in (OIDC via SURFconext)
APP ->> IDM: Lookup user / memberships\n(or SCIM)
IDM -->> APP: Groups
APP -->> Guest: Access if groups match

== 4. Unassign member (MidPoint → Invite; drift prevention) ==
Admin ->> IDM: Unassign Invite-SCIM User\nfrom Invite-SCIM Role
Bridge ->> IDM: Poll memberships (snapshot)
note right of Bridge
  Only roles with costCenter=invite:…
  and extension/scimResource;
  only users with scimResource.
end note
Bridge ->> Invite: DELETE /api/external/v1/user_roles\n/by_provisioned_scim/{userScimId}/{groupScimId}
Invite -->> Bridge: 204 or 404 (idempotent)
note right of Bridge
  On Invite 5xx: log/alert;
  MidPoint revoke already done
  (app security not blocked).
end note

== 5. Delete role (MidPoint → Invite) ==
Admin ->> IDM: Delete Role
Bridge ->> IDM: Poll (Role gone)
Bridge ->> Invite: DELETE /api/external/v1/roles/{id}
Invite ->> SCIM: DELETE /Groups (optional echo)
SCIM ->> IDM: Group DELETE no-op\n(leading mode; Role already removed)

@enduml
